1
00:00:00,593 --> 00:00:02,333
(Bernadette:)Well, it's just, after last time,

2
00:00:02,461 --> 00:00:04,171
(Bernadette:)I didn't think you'd
ever want to go back.

3
00:00:04,297 --> 00:00:07,437
(Howard:)Are you kidding? It was the greatest
experience of my life.

4
00:00:07,567 --> 00:00:10,567
Really? 'Cause I kind of
remember a lot of complaining

5
00:00:10,736 --> 00:00:12,846
(Bernadette:)and wishing for it to be over.

6
00:00:14,006 --> 00:00:15,316
(Howard:)I think you have me confused

7
00:00:15,474 --> 00:00:18,084
(Howard:)with what's gonna happen when
you get out of that shower.

8
00:00:23,182 --> 00:00:24,682
(Leonard:)Hey, all set.
What do you think?

9
00:00:24,850 --> 00:00:27,760
(Leonard:)There's plenty of room for everybody,
a view out the window.

10
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:30,090
(Sheldon:)My spot on the couch
has a great view of a window.

11
00:00:30,122 --> 00:00:33,032
(Sheldon:)Sometimes I can see
space battles through it.

12
00:00:33,192 --> 00:00:34,292
(Sheldon:)It's called a TV.

13
00:00:35,995 --> 00:00:38,705
(Penny:)Give it a chance, Sheldon,
you might actually like it.

14
00:00:39,799 --> 00:00:41,469
(Sheldon:)You're absolutely right.

15
00:00:44,103 --> 00:00:45,553
(Sheldon:)Nope.

16
00:00:47,807 --> 00:00:50,217
(Penny:)Well, you can't say he
didn't give it a fair shot.

17
00:00:50,376 --> 00:00:52,046
(Sheldon:)So, when can we get rid of it?

18
00:00:52,178 --> 00:00:53,118
(Sheldon:)We're not.

19
00:00:53,179 --> 00:00:55,159
(Sheldon:)What about the roommate agreement?

20
00:00:55,314 --> 00:00:58,124
(Sheldon:)It specifically states
that any changes in furnishing

21
00:00:58,284 --> 00:01:00,234
(Sheldon:)have to be approved
by the Furnishing Committee.

